   "ColorRole": "SymbolText"
  },
  {
   "Kind": "Text",
   "X": 15846.0,
   "Y": 1325.0,
   "Text": "MIM capacitor: area and fringe C, series R\nSiGe HBT: VBIC 1.3 with the PDK's scaling; DC and HB\nSiGe HBT, long emitter: VBIC 1.3\nSiGe HBT, high voltage: VBIC 1.3\nhigh-ohmic poly resistor: CMC R3\npoly resistor: CMC R3\nsilicided poly resistor: CMC R3 (the PDK's r3_cmc.osdi)\n3.3 V NMOS: PSP 103.6\n3.3 V PMOS: PSP 103.6\n1.2 V NMOS: PSP 103.6 (the PDK's psp103.osdi)\n1.2 V PMOS: PSP 103.6\nRF MIM (skin L/R, oxide, substrate network): not ported yet\nantenna diode (ngspice diode cards): not ported yet\nESD diode to VDD (ngspice diode cards): not ported yet\nESD diode to VDD (ngspice diode cards): not ported yet\nESD diode to VSS (ngspice diode cards): not ported yet\nESD diode to VSS (ngspice diode cards): not ported yet\np+ antenna diode (ngspice diode cards): not ported yet\nESD diode to VDD, inverted: not ported yet\nESD diode to VDD, inverted: not ported yet\nESD diode to VSS, inverted: not ported yet\nESD diode to VSS, inverted: not ported yet\nisolation box, two ngspice diodes: not ported yet\nESD clamp NMOS (PSP 103): not ported yet\nESD clamp NMOS (PSP 103): not ported yet\nn-well tap, a plain resistor in the PDK: not ported yet\np-substrate tap, a plain resistor in the PDK: not ported yet",
   "FontSize": 150,
   "FontStyle": "Regular",
   "Align": "Left",
   "VAlign": "Top",
   "ColorRole": "SymbolText"
  }
 ],
